sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (React UI)
    participant API as Flask API
    participant Queue as Work Queue
    participant Worker as Worker Thread
    participant Executor as Pipeline Executor
    participant Runner as Agent Runner
    participant Agent as Devin Agent

    User->>API: 1. Create Task
    API->>API: 2. Create task.md + insert into queue
    API->>Queue: Insert task
    Queue->>Worker: 3. Background worker polls queue
    Worker->>Worker: 4. Claim task (queued → claimed)
    Worker->>Executor: 5. Load pipeline.yaml<br/>Auto-select agent

    Note over Executor,Agent: STAGE 1: PLANNER
    Executor->>Runner: 6. Call agent_runner (planner)
    Runner->>Runner: 7. Load skills/planner/agent.yaml
    Runner->>Runner: 8. Build prompt + read files
    Runner->>Agent: 9. Execute agent
    Agent->>Agent: Reads: task.md
    Agent->>Agent: Writes: planner.requirements.md<br/>planner.design.md
    Agent->>Agent: Prints: <<<PLANNER_COMPLETE>>>
    Agent-->>Runner: Completion token
    Runner->>Runner: 10. Detect completion token<br/>Create .done file<br/>Kill process
    Runner-->>Executor: Stage complete
    Executor->>Executor: 11. Move to next stage

    Note over Executor,Agent: STAGE 2: CODER
    Executor->>Runner: 12. Call agent_runner (coder)
    Runner->>Runner: 13. Load skills/coder/agent.yaml
    Runner->>Runner: 14. Build prompt (includes planner outputs)
    Runner->>Agent: 15. Execute agent
    Agent->>Agent: Reads: task.md, planner docs
    Agent->>Agent: Writes: source code files
    Agent->>Agent: Prints: <<<CODER_COMPLETE>>>
    Agent-->>Runner: Completion token
    Runner->>Runner: 16. Detect completion<br/>.done → kill process
    Runner-->>Executor: Stage complete
    Executor->>Executor: 17. Post-stage: generate coder.diff

    Note over Executor,Agent: STAGE 3: REVIEWER
    Executor->>Runner: 18. Call agent_runner (reviewer)
    Runner->>Runner: 19. Load skills/reviewer/agent.yaml
    Runner->>Agent: 20. Execute agent
    Agent->>Agent: Reads: task.md, planner docs, coder.diff
    Agent->>Agent: Writes: reviewer.review.md
    Agent->>Agent: Prints: <<<REVIEWER_COMPLETE>>>
    Agent-->>Runner: Completion token
    Runner-->>Executor: Stage complete
    Executor->>Executor: 22. Extract verdict from reviewer.review.md

    Note over Executor: VERDICT-BASED ROUTING
    par GO
        Executor->>Executor: 23. Run hooks<br/>- git commit<br/>- git push<br/>- create PR
        Executor->>Executor: Task → done
    and FAIL
        Executor->>Executor: 24. Route back → CODER<br/>Retry coding stage
        Executor->>Executor: Requeued (retry from coding)
    and SPEC_FAIL
        Executor->>Executor: 25. Route back → PLANNER<br/>Retry planning stage
        Executor->>Executor: Requeued (retry from planning)
    and ESCALATE
        Executor->>Executor: 26. Pause task for human<br/>Status → escalated
    end
